# Catalog
**Acme Parts | stocked components and supplier terms**

The catalog contains 48 stocked components across six families. Unit costs exclude freight and tax; pack quantities reflect supplier order multiples. Bearings carry a higher service target because shortages can stop assembly.

Supplier lead times are working days. Review the catalog before placing orders if quoted prices or availability have changed.

