# Demand History
**Twelve-week outbound demand | July–September 2026**

Weekly issues are summarized from warehouse dispatches. The daily estimate assumes five trading days per week. Variability is translated from weekly demand under an independent-day planning assumption; promotions and customer project spikes require a separate review.

