# Stock Plan
**Monday replenishment review | stock, commitments and purchase quantities**

Inventory position includes stock on hand and inbound purchase orders, less customer allocations. Orders are triggered below the lead-time reorder point and restore the five-day review-cycle target in whole supplier packs.

The service target is a cycle-service probability, not a unit fill rate. Items flagged for expediting need an availability check before the routine order is released.

| @meta |  || {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:.2f} | {:.2f} | {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:.1%} | {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:,.2f} {::>} |  | {:,.2f} {::>} |  |
|  | SKU || On hand | On order | Allocated | Inventory position | Daily mean | Daily SD | Lead days | Review days | Service target | Safety stock | Reorder point | Target stock | Pack size | Order units | Order cost | Supplier | Inventory value | Priority |
|  | --- || --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
|  | ACME-101 || 100 | 60 | 0 | = B2 + C2 - D2 | = lookup(A2, @["Demand History"::A2:A49], @["Demand History"::N2:N49]) | = lookup(A2, @["Demand History"::A2:A49], @["Demand History"::O2:O49]) | = lookup(A2, @[Catalog::A2:A49], @[Catalog::G2:G49]) | 5 | = lookup(A2, @[Catalog::A2:A49], @[Catalog::H2:H49]) | = ceil(normalInv(J2) * G2 * sqrt(H2)) | = ceil(F2 * H2 + K2) | = ceil(F2 * (H2 + I2) + normalInv(J2) * G2 * sqrt(H2 + I2)) | = lookup(A2, @[Catalog::A2:A49], @[Catalog::F2:F49]) | = if(E2 < L2, ceilMultiple(M2 - E2, N2), 0) | = O2 * lookup(A2, @[Catalog::A2:A49], @[Catalog::E2:E49]) | = lookup(A2, @[Catalog::A2:A49], @[Catalog::D2:D49]) | = B2 * lookup(A2, @[Catalog::A2:A49], @[Catalog::E2:E49]) | = if(B2 - D2 < F2 * H2, "Expedite review", "Routine") |
