# Supplier Orders
**Purchase release by supplier**

The purchasing coordinator consolidates pack-rounded requirements into supplier orders. Planned spend excludes freight and tax. Expedite requests are handled separately from standard weekly releases.

| @meta |  || {:.0f} | {:.0f} | {:,.2f} {::>} | {:,.2f} {::>} | {:.0f} |  |  |
|  | Supplier || Stocked SKUs | Order units | Planned spend | Stock value | Order lines | Terms | Buyer note |
|  | --- || --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
|  | North Components || = count(filter(@["Stock Plan"::A2:A49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A2[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A2[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::P2:P49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A2[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::R2:R49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A2[0])) | = count(filter(filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A2[0]), filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A2[0]) > 0)) | Net 30 | Standard weekly release |
|  | East Industrial || = count(filter(@["Stock Plan"::A2:A49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A3[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A3[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::P2:P49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A3[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::R2:R49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A3[0])) | = count(filter(filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A3[0]), filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A3[0]) > 0)) | Net 30 | Standard weekly release |
|  | Central Hardware || = count(filter(@["Stock Plan"::A2:A49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A4[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A4[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::P2:P49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A4[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::R2:R49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A4[0])) | = count(filter(filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A4[0]), filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A4[0]) > 0)) | Net 30 | Standard weekly release |
|  | West Motion || = count(filter(@["Stock Plan"::A2:A49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A5[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A5[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::P2:P49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A5[0])) | = sum(filter(@["Stock Plan"::R2:R49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A5[0])) | = count(filter(filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A5[0]), filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::Q2:Q49] == A5[0]) > 0)) | Net 30 | Standard weekly release |
