# Purchasing Summary
**Warehouse and procurement | October opening review**

The review distinguishes available inventory from purchase commitments. Orders should be approved after confirming inbound deliveries and any customer allocations that changed over the weekend.

| Metric || Value |
| --- || --- |
| Planned spend || = sum(@["Stock Plan"::P2:P49]) {:,.2f} {::>,bold,green} |
| Items needing an order || = count(filter(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49], @["Stock Plan"::O2:O49] > 0)) |
| Order units || = sum(@["Stock Plan"::O2:O49]) |
| Inventory at cost || = sum(@["Stock Plan"::R2:R49]) {:,.2f} {::>} |
| Units on hand || = sum(@["Stock Plan"::B2:B49]) |
| Inbound units || = sum(@["Stock Plan"::C2:C49]) |
| Allocated units || = sum(@["Stock Plan"::D2:D49]) |
| Available before allocation || = @["Units on hand",_] + @["Inbound units",_] |
| Net available units || = @[_-1,_] - @["Allocated units",_] |
| Expedite reviews || = count(filter(@["Stock Plan"::A2:A49], @["Stock Plan"::S2:S49] == "Expedite review")) |
| Supplier count || 6 |
| SKU count || 48 |
| Review cadence || Every Monday |
| Release date || 2026-10-05 {:%Y-%m-%d} |
| Buyer action || Confirm outstanding deliveries before releasing orders |
